stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CREATED_OFFLINE: Foreman Logs Attendance
    CREATED_OFFLINE --> HASH_CHAINED: HMAC-SHA256 Chain Generated
    HASH_CHAINED --> ENCRYPTED_AT_REST: Written to SQLCipher DB
    
    ENCRYPTED_AT_REST --> SYNC_QUEUED: Device Connects to Internet
    SYNC_QUEUED --> TEE_SIGNED: Signed by Hardware Enclave
    
    TEE_SIGNED --> VERIFYING_SERVER: Transmitted to REST API
    
    VERIFYING_SERVER --> VERIFIED_SYNCED: Signature & Chain Validated
    VERIFYING_SERVER --> FLAGGED_TAMPERED: Validation Failed
    
    VERIFIED_SYNCED --> PAYROLL_APPROVED: Processed by Payroll Engine
    FLAGGED_TAMPERED --> MANUAL_HR_AUDIT: Sent to Site Engineer Review
    
    MANUAL_HR_AUDIT --> PAYROLL_APPROVED: Engineer Overrides Flag
    PAYROLL_APPROVED --> [*]
